1
00:00:00,364 --> 00:00:02,194
(Leonard:)Yeah, it's a perfectly good word.

2
00:00:02,366 --> 00:00:06,536
I mean, you put it in front of "dokay"
and you really got something.

3
00:00:07,663 --> 00:00:09,123
All right, let's not overreact.

4
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:12,130
(Penny:)It takes time
to get to know each other's rhythms.

5
00:00:12,293 --> 00:00:14,543
(Penny:)Learn what the other person wants
and likes.

6
00:00:14,712 --> 00:00:17,882
(Leonard:)-So you've been through this before?
-No.

7
00:00:19,883 --> 00:00:21,723
(Leonard:)Okay-dokay.

8
00:00:23,304 --> 00:00:27,144
(Penny:)This is one of those things where talking
about it is not gonna make it better.

9
00:00:27,308 --> 00:00:30,558
-Want a glass of wine? Okay.
-So much.

10
00:00:30,728 --> 00:00:33,058
(Penny:)See, we should've done this last night,
you know?

11
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,400
Had a little wine, take the edge off.

12
00:00:35,566 --> 00:00:39,236
(Leonard:)Actually, ethyl alcohol inhibits
electrical conduction in the nerve cells...

13
00:00:39,403 --> 00:00:42,573
(Leonard:)...and stimulates reuptake receptors
of inhibitory neurotransmitters...

14
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:45,280
(Leonard:)...like gamma-aminobutyric acid.

15
00:00:48,829 --> 00:00:51,249
(Penny:)Don't talk. Just drink.

16
00:00:53,625 --> 00:00:54,955
(Howard:)No, you're misunderstanding.

17
00:00:55,127 --> 00:00:59,027
(Howard:)A shiksa goddess
isn't an actual goddess.

